Legacy prompt scaffold. The installable Claude Code plugin commands now live in `plugins/lifeyoda/commands/`; source-checkout commands live in `.claude/commands/`.

Run `workflows/morning-brief-and-plan.md`.

Claude Code runtime:
- Read Google Calendar directly with the configured calendar connector.
- Read Outlook Calendar directly when available.
- Slack is optional for messages, mentions, and app notifications; it is not required as the Outlook Calendar proxy unless private config requests it.
- Do not write Notion or calendar entries during this command.
- Output Morning Brief and Draft Day Plan only.
